{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "59c78a49-62ab-852e-9816-0a98b6575d9e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T13:45:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ricardo D. Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Ricardo Rivera. I am calling on behalf of my mother, and she wishes to obtain a marriage license. Kindly tell me what we need to bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:43:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, how nice. Congratulations to her. So it's your mother who's getting married, and she'd be coming in with her partner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:43:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Both of them would come to the office together. I would be driving them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:43:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Both of them need to come in person, together. You don't need to be there for the application itself, but you're welcome to wait with them. They'll each fill out a form here at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And what identification should they bring? Kindly be specific, as my mother will want to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:43:57-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Each of them should bring a valid photo ID, like a driver's license or a passport. If either one was married before, they should bring the information about how that marriage ended, the date and where. And it helps to have their Social Security numbers handy, you don't need the card itself, just the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:44:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photo identification, and the particulars of any prior marriage. Yes. My mother was widowed some years ago, so she will have the date. [pause] I have it written. And her gentleman friend was divorced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then he'll want the date of the divorce and the place it was finalized. If he has the paperwork, bring it, just in case."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:44:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very good. I shall tell him. Are there particular hours when they ought to come? It is quiet here today, the roads are wet from the rain on Monday, and I would rather not drive in a crowd."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:44:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that was a messy one, snow and then rain. We're open regular business hours, weekdays. Mid-morning or early afternoon tends to be calmer. Just don't come right at closing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I will plan for the early afternoon. By the way, there is a child down the street who sells lemonade every summer, and my mother always buys a cup. It put me in mind of her routine, that is all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:45:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a sweet routine. Anything else I can tell you before you go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:45:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Photo identification for both, and the details of previous marriages. Kindly accept my thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it exactly. You're welcome, Mr. Rivera. Tell your mother congratulations from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:45:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Good afternoon."
    }
  ],
